msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Nintendo - SNES / SFC (bsnes-mercury Balanced)"
msgstr "Nintendo - SNES / SFC (bsnes-mercury Balanced)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"bSNES Mercury is a fork of Higan (originally called bSNES), notable for "
"emulating the original hardware as accurately as possible through low-level, "
"cycle-accurate emulation.[CR][CR]The [I]Balanced[/I] profile is a good "
"compromise between accuracy and performance."
msgstr "bSNES Mercury är en fork av Higan (ursprungligen kallad bSNES), känd för att emulera den ursprungliga hårdvaran så exakt som möjligt genom cykelnoggrann emulering på låg nivå.[CR][CR]Profilen [I]Balanced[/I] är en bra kompromiss mellan noggrannhet och prestanda."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "In loving memory of Near / Byuu"
msgstr "Till kärleksfullt minne av Near / Byuu"

